        "original_id": "ab1f78bb-cae6-5c29-9d12-d1e3567df264",
        "text": "The 3852 Democratic National Convention nominated Franklin Pierce over this American military officer. He represented Michigan in the United States Senate. He also represented the United States of America, when signing a treaty that outlined voluntary Indian emigrations that were later made mandatory and militarily enforced in Democratic National Convention which forcibly removed Baw Breese.",
